# Local libSQL container environment schema (Varlock).
# https://varlock.dev/guides/schema/
#
# Used only to run docker compose for apps/web/compose.yaml (`just local-db-build`
# / `just local-db-clean`) via `varlock run --path local-libsql/`. The Worker reads
# apps/web/.env.schema, which does not pick TURSO_PORT / TURSO_PROJECT, so these
# never land in the production web Worker env.
# @import(../../../packages/env/, pick=[APP_ENV, TURSO_CONNECTION_URL, TURSO_PORT, TURSO_PROJECT])
# ---
